5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all today. Let us be thoughtful in our choices so we may support the most deserving research. I look forward to our discussion.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. We should be thorough. To ensure the project is actually feasible, I believe we need to look closely at the human resources and technical support available to the candidates.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Ryuji. However, we must also consider the infrastructure. If the shared facilities are overstretched, even the best-staffed project will fail. We should examine the state of those services.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, infrastructure is key. However, I am curious about the actual purchasing power of these grants. It would be prudent to see how costs are distributed between the agency and the awardees.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree that feasibility is vital. I am also concerned about potential delays that aren't related to the science itself, so I'd like to see where bottlenecks occur.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It is wonderful to see such a focused start. I believe it would be wise to look at the history of our previous successes to guide us. I shall look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":44,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I will focus on the human element. I intend to examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength to verify the actual availability of personnel.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I will look into the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities, as well as the incident logs on shared instrumentation, to assess the current pressure on our core infrastructure.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"To complement the others' focus on personnel and hardware, I shall examine the national computing agreement and facility day rates, along with the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers. Logic suggests the numbers tell the truest story.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I think it would be helpful to see where things often stall. I will look into the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the national repository deposit turnaround to identify those non-scientific bottlenecks.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a very comprehensive plan. I am glad we are all so diligent. Is there anything else anyone feels is missing before we proceed with our research?,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I believe our current selections cover the primary risks. By cross-referencing personnel availability with infrastructure and financial data, we should have a clear picture of which proposal is truly viable. I am satisfied.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. We have covered the human, financial, and structural dimensions. I believe these data points will provide the necessary context to make a rational and sustainable decision.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I concur. We have cast a wide net, and the synergy between our chosen data points should be quite illuminating. I see no reason to delay our investigation further.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree as well. It feels like we have a very balanced approach. I'm looking forward to seeing what we discover and how it helps us make the right choice.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Then we are all in agreement. Let us proceed with a kind and open heart, trusting that the information we find will lead us to the best possible outcome for the science.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Let us move forward and examine the data. I will wait for the results of our investigations to inform the next stage of our deliberation.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I concur. Let us move to the investigation phase. I look forward to seeing how the current state of our shared services aligns with the candidates' requirements.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,A most agreeable conclusion to our first round. I shall retreat into the ledgers and agreements now; I suspect the figures will have some rather interesting things to tell us. Until we meet again.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. I'll go and see what the records show about those delays. I hope the information helps us support a project that can truly flourish. See you all soon!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
