73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. We have carefully cross-referenced the proposals with the actual state of our facilities and staffing. Candidate D is the only sustainable choice. I am satisfied with this outcome.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
