75,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. It is a refreshing change of pace to reach a consensus so efficiently. We have successfully navigated the gap between theoretical ambition and operational reality. I am satisfied.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
