77,3,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. It feels wonderful that we could all work together so harmoniously to find the best path forward. I'm glad we're supporting a project that can truly flourish.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
