79,3,4,talk,Shizue,,It has been a joy to deliberate with you all. May the chosen research bring great benefit to the world. I wish you all a peaceful day.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
